# Hedious

An affront to God himself. A creation so vile neither the soil below nor the heavens above accept it, forcing it to be thrown around in the cold, uncaring winds between. It is believed this creature was cast into this torment by its own creator, utterly disgusted at the sight of what they made

It is also considered a delicacy among locals.

# tasty

A delicacy among various machines, often sought after and cultivated. Due to its biological structure it cannot survive outside its natural habitat for long.

often found swimming among the roots of its source

# electric

A highly energetic fish, feeding off of malicious data in its path. One of the smarter fish, always able to find the easiest way to its destination

Common in high energy industrial environments

# scrap

Unlike its cousins, this machine seems to have settled for a lower, safer local optimum guaranteed by its enviroment instead of the higher, riskier combat encounters. It reinforces itself using the mangled bits of scrap that litter its enviroment, and gathers nutrients from the crushed flesh.

while it utilizes a diffrent strategy for harvesting resources, it seems that it still often immitates others, leading to a lot of individuals sharing nearly identical structures

# ancient

A manmade fish, created due to the extremely harsh environment in which it resides, legends say that the text carved in it describes the construction of of the monuments around it, prefers boiling hot waters

# wine

A valuable and luxurious fish, often nurtured for prolonged periods of time before consumption, it is said that the older the fish, the fancier the taste

Can be found in extravagant establishments and luxurious cruises

# vapor

A synthetic fish, produced by the interaction of technology with older culture, while it does not represent the culture accurately, and instead showcases a distorted version of it, it attracts the eye of the residents, most commonly those who never had the chance to experience the old culture by themselves

# Plastic

While the vast majority of Mindflayers adapt a humanoid form, a few have chosen to adapt a non standard form, the reasoning as to why is not fully known, although it seems to be directly linked to a drastic decrease in agressiveness, with them often being completely peacefull

prefer secluded, desolate parts of structures

